  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Afrobarometer 04-07 - Evaluation of the AB</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Afrobarometern 04-07</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Afrobarometern (AB) &#xe4;r en serie av unders&#xf6;kningar av allm&#xe4;nhetens inst&#xe4;llning till demokrati, marknader och civilsamh&#xe4;llet i Afrika. AB genomf&#xf6;rs i ett dussin afrikanska l&#xe4;nder med syftet att visa befolkningens och marknadens attityder till demokrati och social utveckling, samt deras egna roller i dessa processer och hur v&#xe4;l deras regeringar representerar deras &#xf6;nskningar och behov.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Afrobarometer is a comparative series of public attitude surveys on democracy, markets and civil society in Africa. It&apos;s conducted in a dozen African countries with the purpose to show the inhabitants attitude to democracy and social development as well as their roles within these processes and how well their governments represents their needs and wishes.</narrative>
  </description>
